<title>USA: Western Digital raises authorized shrs.</title>
<headline>Western Digital raises authorized shrs.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Digital Corp said a proposal to increase the authorized number of common shares from 95 million to 225 million and to change par value to $0.01 per share was approved by shareholders at a special meeting of its stockholders held March 11.</p>
<p>Western Digital said it increased the number of authorized shares to have them available for issuance to meet business needs that may arise in the future.</p>
</text>
